msgid "Deactivate GPS and autopilot\\n"
msgstr "Désactiver GPS et Auto-pilote\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_006"
msgid "Disable primary power source\\n"
msgstr "Désactiver source d'énergie principale\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_007"
msgid "Secure laboratories and research data\\n"
msgstr "Sécuriser labos et données de recherche\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_008"
msgid "Activate Moon Pool lift\\n"
msgstr "Activer l'ascenseur du sas\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_009"
msgid "Rendezvous and escape with Elvis\\n"
msgstr "Retrouver Elvis et s'enfuir avec lui\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_010"
msgid "Cripple the engines and the ship will \\ndrift... Perfect!\\n"
msgstr "On sabote les moteurs et le vaisseau \\ndérivera... Parfait!\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_011"
msgid "This must be where the sub's controlled from.\\n"
msgstr "Le sous-marin doit être contrôlé d'ici. \\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_012"
msgid "Without the autopilot and the GPS, the ship \\nwill wander off station.\\n"
msgstr "Sans auto-pilote ni GPS, l'appareil \\ns'éloignera de la station. \\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_013"
msgid "They'll be unable to conduct any operations \\nwithout any power.\\n"
msgstr "Ils ne pourront plus continuer l'opération \\nsans énergie.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_014"
msgid "Autopilot system has been deactivated.\\n"
msgstr "Système auto-pilote désactivé.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_015"
msgid "GPS system has been deactivated.\\n"
msgstr "Système GPS désactivé.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_016"
msgid "Critical mission object has been destroyed.\\n"
msgstr "Objet crucial détruit.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_017"
msgid "Reactor shutdown control hatch opened.\\n"
msgstr "Porte de commande d'arrêt du réacteur ouverte.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_018"
msgid "Reactor has been shut down.\\n"
msgstr "Réacteur désactivé.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_019"
msgid "Diving control center has been located.\\n"
msgstr "Centre de contrôle de plongée localisé.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_020"
msgid "Critical mission personnel killed.\\n"
msgstr "Personnel crucial abattu.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_021"
msgid "Research data has been secured.\\n"
msgstr "Données de recherche sécurisées.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_022"
msgid "\\n"
msgstr "\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_023"
msgid "\\n"
msgstr "\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_024"
msgid "Research data disk\\n"
msgstr "Disque de recherche\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_025"
msgid "A research data disk\\n"
msgstr "Un disque de recherche\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_026"
msgid "Picked up a research data disk.\\n"
msgstr "Disque de recherche obtenu.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_027"
msgid "Critical mission personnel have been killed.\\n"
msgstr "Personnel crucial abattu.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_028"
msgid "Lift door has been unlocked.\\n"
msgstr "Porte ascenseur déverrouillée.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_029"
msgid "Lift has been activated.\\n"
msgstr "Ascenseur activé.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_030"
msgid "Operation denied - hangar doors still closed.\\n"
msgstr "Opération refusée - portes du hangar fermées.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_031"
msgid "Unlocking sequence has been reset.\\n"
msgstr "Séquence de déverrouillage réinitialisée.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_032"
msgid "You go on ahead, Jo. I'll secure the perimeter. \\nWe'll meet up later.\\n"
msgstr "Vas-y. Je sécurise le périmètre. \\nOn se retrouve plus tard.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_033"
msgid "Elvis has been killed.\\n"
msgstr "Elvis a été abattu.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_034"
msgid ""
"Joanna... What took you so long? Follow me - \\nlet's get out of this old "
"tub.\\n"
msgstr "Qu'est-ce que tu faisais? Suis-moi... \\nOn décampe.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_035"
msgid "Civilians have been killed.\\n"
msgstr "Des civils ont été abattus.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_036"
msgid "Critical mission object has been destroyed.\\n"
msgstr "Objet crucial détruit.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_037"
msgid "Alarm has been activated.\\n"
msgstr "Alarme activée.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_038"
msgid "Alarm has been deactivated.\\n"
msgstr "Alarme désactivée.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_039"
msgid ""
"Right. The diving operation has been disrupted on the surface. \\nTime for a"
" swim.\\n"
msgstr ""
"Bien. L'opération de plongée a été annulée à la surface. \\nIl est temps de "
"piquer une tête.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_040"
msgid "I hope the government don't want to use this ship anytime soon.\\n"
msgstr ""
"J'espère que le gouvernement ne compte pas utiliser ce vaisseau tout de "
"suite.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_041"
msgid "Do you think we were a little heavy-handed?\\n"
msgstr "On y est allé un peu fort, non?\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_042"
msgid "Naaahhhh.\\n"
msgstr "Mais non.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_043"
msgid "Pull the plug on that now.\\n"
msgstr "Débranche ce truc.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_044"
msgid "Switch this thing off.\\n"
msgstr "Eteins-moi ça.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_045"
msgid "I'll shut it down.\\n"
msgstr "Je vais l'éteindre.\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_046"
msgid "Please don't hurt me.\\n"
msgstr "Ne me faites pas de mal!\\n"

msgctxt "L_DAM_047"
msgid "Die, you traitors.\\n"
msgstr "Crevez, charognes!\\n"
